cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "ACTIONet: a multiresolution framework for single-cell state landscapes"
abstract: >-
  ACTIONet combines archetypal analysis with manifold learning to describe each
  cell as a mixture of a small number of interpretable extreme states, resolved
  at multiple resolutions simultaneously. The result is a cell-cell network and
  matching embedding that support continuous rather than discrete
  characterisation of cell identity.
